{{!-- Who this is for — the three readers the site is written for,
as a STACK: three full-width cards that pile up as you scroll
(position: sticky with a growing top offset, no script), each a
face, the gap they are closing, the two things that help, and
the door to walk through first. Fixed copy on purpose: it is the
positioning, not content that should drift with the post list.

The faces are Unsplash photos (free licence, hotlinked at card
size) standing in for real readers — swap the URLs for your own
when you have them. What DOES drift is the number under each
door: live {{#get}} counts, the pagination total of a one-item
query, so the doors never promise more than the site holds. --}}
<section class="section outer home-audience relative">
    <div class="bg-rings" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="inner relative">
        <div class="section-head" data-animate>
            <div>
                <span class="kicker">{{> "icons/avatar"}} {{t "Who this is for"}}</span>
                <h2>{{t "Three readers, one trail"}}</h2>
                <p>{{t "Salesforce is the way in, not the destination. Pick the door that sounds like you — every one of them joins the same path."}}</p>
            </div>
            <a class="section-more" href="{{@site.url}}/training/">{{t "See the whole trail"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</a>
        </div>

        <div class="audience-stack" data-animate-stagger>

            <a class="audience-card" href="{{@site.url}}/training/" style="--i: 0;">
                <span class="audience-photo" aria-hidden="true">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=720&amp;q=80" alt="" loading="lazy" width="720" height="540" />
                    <span class="audience-num">01</span>
                    <span class="audience-ico">{{> "icons/cloud"}}</span>
                </span>
                <span class="audience-copy">
                    <span class="audience-top">
                        <span class="audience-kicker">{{t "The builder"}}</span>
                    </span>
                    <h3>{{t "The Salesforce admin or developer"}}</h3>
                    <p class="audience-gap">{{t "You can build the org. You want to understand the revenue process it runs — and stop being the last to hear why a deal moved."}}</p>
                    <ul class="audience-list">
                        <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}} {{t "Sales cycle, lead routing, quote-to-cash — explained before the objects"}}</li>
                        <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}} {{t "Flow and Apex patterns that survive production"}}</li>
                    </ul>
                    <span class="audience-meta">
                        {{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-module" limit="1" as |m mods|}}<span>{{> "icons/layers"}} {{mods.total}} {{t "modules"}}</span>{{/get}}
                        {{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-training" limit="1" as |s secs|}}<span>{{> "icons/file-text"}} {{secs.total}} {{t "sections"}}</span>{{/get}}
                    </span>
                    <span class="audience-go">{{t "Start the training trail"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</span>
                </span>
            </a>

            <a class="audience-card is-featured" href="{{@site.url}}/courses/" style="--i: 1;">
                <span class="audience-photo" aria-hidden="true">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551434678-e076c223a692?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=720&amp;q=80" alt="" loading="lazy" width="720" height="540" />
                    <span class="audience-num">02</span>
                    <span class="audience-ico">{{> "icons/sparkles"}}</span>
                </span>
                <span class="audience-copy">
                    <span class="audience-top">
                        <span class="audience-kicker">{{t "The mover"}}</span>
                        <span class="audience-flag">{{> "icons/signal"}} {{t "Where I am now"}}</span>
                    </span>
                    <h3>{{t "Moving into an AI or GTM engineering role"}}</h3>
                    <p class="audience-gap">{{t "You have the CRM. The next job wants n8n, Clay, 6sense, Agentforce and an LLM doing the clicking. This is the stack, learned in the open."}}</p>
                    <ul class="audience-list">
                        <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}} {{t "Agentforce end to end, prompts that earn their keep"}}</li>
                        <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}} {{t "The GTM tooling around Salesforce, piece by piece"}}</li>
                    </ul>
                    <span class="audience-meta">
                        {{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-course" limit="1" as |c courses|}}<span>{{> "icons/graduation-cap"}} {{courses.total}} {{t "courses"}}</span>{{/get}}
                        {{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-prompt" limit="1" as |p prompts|}}<span>{{> "icons/sparkles"}} {{prompts.total}} {{t "prompts"}}</span>{{/get}}
                    </span>
                    <span class="audience-go">{{t "Browse the courses"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</span>
                </span>
            </a>

            <a class="audience-card" href="{{@site.url}}/courses/" style="--i: 2;">
                <span class="audience-photo" aria-hidden="true">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=720&amp;q=80" alt="" loading="lazy" width="720" height="540" />
                    <span class="audience-num">03</span>
                    <span class="audience-ico">{{> "icons/graduation-cap"}}</span>
                </span>
                <span class="audience-copy">
                    <span class="audience-top">
                        <span class="audience-kicker">{{t "The newcomer"}}</span>
                    </span>
                    <h3>{{t "New to the ecosystem"}}</h3>
                    <p class="audience-gap">{{t "You know a spreadsheet and you want a step-by-step way in that does not cost anything and does not skip the why."}}</p>
                    <ul class="audience-list">
                        <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}} {{t "Admin Foundations, free, in a Developer Edition org"}}</li>
                        <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}} {{t "Every lesson ends with something running in your org"}}</li>
                    </ul>
                    <span class="audience-meta">
                        {{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-lesson" limit="1" as |l lessons|}}<span>{{> "icons/play-circle"}} {{lessons.total}} {{t "lessons"}}</span>{{/get}}
                        {{#get "posts" filter="tag:hash-video" limit="1" as |v vids|}}<span>{{> "icons/video"}} {{vids.total}} {{t "videos"}}</span>{{/get}}
                    </span>
                    <span class="audience-go">{{t "Open lesson one"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</span>
                </span>
            </a>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
